[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=Honor 6X Portrait
Name[zh_CN]=荣耀畅玩6X 竖屏模式
Comment=Restart the graphical session in portrait mode
Comment[zh_CN]=恢复竖屏、触摸坐标与竖屏壁纸，并重新登录桌面
Exec=/usr/bin/honor6x-displayctl portrait
Icon=video-display
Terminal=false
Categories=Settings;HardwareSettings;X-XFCE-SettingsDialog;
OnlyShowIn=XFCE;
